BEHAVIOR build-post

DESCRIPTION
  Builds a minimal HTTP/1.0 POST request whose body is the given bytes.
  Header is "POST / HTTP/1.0\r\n\r\n" (19 bytes); body is copied after it.
  Outputs the full request bytes and its total length.

CONTRACT
  INPUT body bytes 65536
  INPUT blen int 8
  OUTPUT req bytes 65536
  OUTPUT rlen int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 8188abe2

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE req 80 1 0
  STORE req 79 1 1
  STORE req 83 1 2
  STORE req 84 1 3
  STORE req 32 1 4
  STORE req 47 1 5
  STORE req 32 1 6
  STORE req 72 1 7
  STORE req 84 1 8
  STORE req 84 1 9
  STORE req 80 1 10
  STORE req 47 1 11
  STORE req 49 1 12
  STORE req 46 1 13
  STORE req 48 1 14
  STORE req 13 1 15
  STORE req 10 1 16
  STORE req 13 1 17
  STORE req 10 1 18
  n = LOAD blen 8
  i = ALLOC 8 int
  STORE i 0 8
  LABEL loop_start
  iv = LOAD i 8
  done = IGE iv n 8
  BRANCH done loop_end loop_body
  LABEL loop_body
  src_off = LOAD i 8
  ch = LOAD body 1 src_off
  dst_off = IADD iv 19 8
  STORE req ch 1 dst_off
  nv = IADD iv 1 8
  STORE i nv 8
  JUMP loop_start
  LABEL loop_end
  total = IADD n 19 8
  STORE rlen total 8
  FREE i
END
